      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the dining room, Barinov performs improvised 'culinary magic tricks' for the bewildered sheikh. Meanwhile, Timur drags a singing, drunken Yulya back from the Metropol just as the sheikh accidentally chokes on a flying cherry tomato.",
      "gap": 0.8
